## 2. API Endpoints Contract

All endpoints expect `Authorization: Bearer <JWT>` header for private access.

### 2.1 Lookups Endpoints (Dropdown Sources)
- **Academic Fields (رشته‌های تحصیلی):**
  - **URL:** `GET /api/v1/lookups/academic-fields`
  - **Item Shape:** `{ _id: string, title: string, code?: string, isActive: boolean }`
- **Degree Levels (مقاطع تحصیلی):**
  - **URL:** `GET /api/v1/lookups/degree-levels`
  - **Item Shape:** `{ _id: string, title: string, code?: string, rankOrder?: number, isActive: boolean }`
- **Cities (شهرها - اختیاری):**
  - **URL:** `GET /api/v1/lookups/cities`
  - **Item Shape:** `{ _id: string, title: string, provinceId: string, code?: string }`

---

### 2.2 Member Qualifications Sub-routes

#### A. Get All Qualifications of a Member
- **URL:** `GET /api/v1/members/:id/academic-qualifications`
- **Success Response (`200 OK`):**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Member academic qualifications retrieved successfully",
    "data": [
      {
        "_id": "67104b2a1a89000012345678",
