### 2.3 Global Qualifications Lookup & Verification (Expert Desk)
- **Get All / Filtered Qualifications:**
  `GET /api/v1/lookups/academic-qualifications?verificationStatus=PENDING&memberId=...`
- **Direct Verify Endpoint:**
  `PATCH /api/v1/lookups/academic-qualifications/:id/verify` (Payload matches the sub-route verify payload above).

